"| Unweighted MaxCut |       120        |   100%   |      370       |        60         |          60k          |          6           |\n"
"| HUBO 1            |       156        |   100%   |      600       |        70         |         100k          |          10          |\n"
"| HUBO 2            |       156        |   100%   |      600       |        70         |         100k          |          10          |\n"
msgstr ""
